{"title":"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The smallest <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sum\" title=\"Sum\">sum</a> one could get by adding three different numbers from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Set\" title=\"Set\">set</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/a/56aa9be576d296783f12665c4093409f0212cd3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{ 7,25,-1,12,-3 \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"141\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/3/e634f7bdd6b037efb37fdfb6bccbb6cc491786c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ -3 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ -1 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"383\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The smallest possible sum is found by adding the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> smallest elements of the set.  This sum is  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/a/9fa45ddad1261a34116bff81180c0012ba325b9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-3)+ (-1) + 7 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"209\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME\" title=\"1986 AJHSME\">1986 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1986 AJH